SDV test1:
VSS :
    Sensor Signal Camera (SSP 10ms+/-2ms offset 0ms+/-0ms, DL 5ms+/-2ms)
    Sensor Signal Lidar (SSP 10ms+/-2ms offset 0ms+/-0ms, DL 5ms+/-2ms) 

    Actuator Signal FrontBrake (period 10ms+/-2ms offset 0ms+/-0ms, AD 5ms+/-2ms)
    Actuator Signal RearBrake (period 10ms+/-2ms offset 0ms+/-0ms, AD 5ms+/-2ms)
 
App :
    Component AEBS_controler :
       
 
        Signal Alarm
        Service s1:
            subscribe to VSS signal Camera  
            subscribe to VSS signal Lidar
            publish to VSS signal FrontBrake
            publish to Alarm
            
            trigger on Lidar 
            execution 3ms+/-1ms 

    Component SecondControler :
      
        Service s2:
            subscribe to Alarm
            publish to VSS signal RearBrake 
            period 10ms+/-1ms offset 0ms+/-0ms
            execution 3ms+/-1ms
        Service s3:
        subscribe to Alarm
            trigger on Alarm
            execution 3ms+/-1ms

Functional Chains:
 chain : Lidar -> s1 -> FrontBrake 